research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-1078970-+     "quote": "Under the hypotheses of [[thm-taylor-schlomilch-roche-remainder]], there are points $\\xi_L,\\xi_C$ between $a$ and $x$ such that\n$$R_{n,a}f(x)=\\frac{f^{(n+1)}(\\xi_L)}{\\iota((n+1)!)}(x-a)^{n+1}$$\nand\n$$R_{n,a}f(x)=\\frac{f^{(n+1)}(\\xi_C)}{\\iota(n!)}(x-\\xi_C)^n(x-a).$$",
