research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-1305082-+{"id":"cor-taylor-lagrange-and-cauchy-remainders","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://mathworld.wolfram.com/SchloemilchRemainder.html","https://www.jirka.org/ra/html/sec_taylor.html"],"rationale":"The sources give the Lagrange and Cauchy forms as the corresponding special cases of Taylor's remainder. The item packages both in one corollary under its parent theorem's relative-interval conventions.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
