research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-1305089-+{"id":"ex-piecewise-polynomial-periodic-oscillator","statement":"ai-generated","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"trivial","urls":[],"rationale":"The normalized quartic Hermite cell 16u^2(1-u)^2, its periodic gluing, and the chosen derivative values are a bespoke local construction. Direct polynomial differentiation gives matching value and first derivative at every seam, periodicity and boundedness are immediate from the fractional-part definition, and substituting the displayed quarter-points gives derivative values 3 and -3.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
