research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-1380229-+     "quote": "Let $n\\in\\mathbb N$, and suppose $f$ has derivatives through order $n+1$ on the closed interval between $a$ and $x$, with the usual endpoint continuity. If $|f^{(n+1)}(t)|\\le M$ throughout that interval, then\n$$|R_{n,a}f(x)|\\le \\frac{M}{\\iota((n+1)!)}|x-a|^{n+1}.$$",
research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-1380230-+     "uses": [
